rc-trace v1
max 16
# T12 reset of a unique donor produces a pending token; draining the donor turns it into
# raw storage owned by the token; T13 reuse installs a new value at the same address with
# the next generation.
alloc r1 1
alloc r2 0
write r1 0 r2
reset r1 t1
drain
drain
drain
reuse t1 r3 1
